# Billing rules

Spec: docs/01-PRODUCT.md (Pricing), docs/03-ARCHITECTURE.md (Payments), docs/04-DATA-MODEL.md (Quotas).

- All limits, periods, entitlements and Stripe price ids live ONLY in `src/features/billing/plans.ts`. Never hard-code numbers elsewhere.
- Quota: `checkQuota(user, kind)` → `{ allowed, useBonus }`. Used = successful `AiCall` rows for the kind in the UTC month with `usedBonusCredit = false`. ANALYZE also has a UTC-day abuse cap that counts every successful call that day. Bonus credits do not raise that cap. If over the monthly allowance, an unexpired `BonusCredit` with `remaining > 0` may be used; decrement it in the same transaction as the successful AiCall.
- Failed AI calls never consume quota or bonus credits.
- Pro-only features go through `can(user, feature)` from `entitlements.ts`; deny with `fail("PRO_REQUIRED")`.
- `User.plan`, `billingInterval`, `subscriptionStatus`, `currentPeriodEnd`, `cancelAtPeriodEnd`, `foundingMember`, and `billingCurrency` are changed ONLY by the Stripe webhook.
- Webhook: raw body (`await req.text()`), `Stripe.webhooks.constructEvent`, insert `StripeEvent` first (duplicate → 200), then handle checkout.session.completed, customer.subscription.created/updated/deleted, invoice.payment_failed.
- PRO when subscription status is `active` or `trialing`; otherwise FREE. Interval from the price id. `currentPeriodEnd` from the first subscription item. The payment-failed banner shows when status is `past_due` or `unpaid`.
- Checkout: `client_reference_id = user.id`, reuse `stripeCustomerId`, and send the selected USD or CAD price id from `plans.ts`. The founding coupon is not applied. `foundingOffer` does not change the price. Promotion codes are off. Stripe Tax is on, and the billing address collected at Checkout is saved on the customer.
